# What the anduril mod watches in this project: label=binary@root. The label is the name the tool is run by, the
# binary the built file a run of it runs, and the root the source folder whose edits are edits of it.
# Build it first: cargo build --manifest-path narsil/Cargo.toml
narsil=narsil/target/debug/narsil@narsil
